                   '
                   CON
                   
                   
                   
                   ' if any VGA related options are defined, ensure VGA itself is defined (this
                   ' simplifies subsequent cases).
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
                   
